  "explanation": "The question asks for the population of Rush Township, Ohio. The sources D1S2 and D2S2 provide two conflicting values (3,171 and 12,456) for the 2010 census. Both are valid claims about the same referent (Rush Township, Ohio) and cannot be resolved without external evidence. The value '887' refers to a different Rush Township in Tuscarawas County (D3S2/D4S2), which is not the subject of the question. Therefore, only the two values directly referring to Rush Township, Scioto County, Ohio are retained."
